      "role": "user",
      "content": "I've already checked the logs. They show the handling was perfect all the way to the doorstep—no drops, no impact alerts, nothing. It looks like the damage happened after delivery. Given that, what's your specific recommendation? I want to minimize the cost of this claim without starting a huge fight with the customer. Should we deny it or what?",
